    "title": "Terry Henricks (1943 - 2025) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Newspaper Staff No Comments ,\n22 days ago (Member Of Haven Heights Baptist Church) Terry Eugene Henricks, age 82, of Archbold, Ohio, went home to be with his Lord and Savior on November 14, 2025. He was born in Delta, Ohio, on September 26, 1943. On April 20, 1963, he married the love of his life, Dixie Dawson, who survives. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
